      "cooked": "<p>Good thing there was enough Tuesdays for five topics</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-60\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-60\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-60\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #60</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Good morning, Sentinels! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:27:06 It's another beautiful day here in Letters Page land! Adam and I hadn't recorded in a couple weeks due to the Essen Spiel convension, so we're extra punchy in this recording — we're sorry /...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, November 1st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#229:</span> Writers’ Room: The thing that scared Dark Visionary</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 8th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#230:</span> Creative Process: Darkstrife and Painstake Foes</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 15th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#231:</span> Writers’ Room: A minor villain gets real scary</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 22nd: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#61</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 29th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#232:</span> Writers’ Room: The Mocktriarch Story</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Recording Schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Friday, October 28th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#229:</span> Writers’ Room: The thing that scared Dark Visionary</li>\n<li>Friday, November 4th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#230:</span> Creative Process: Darkstrife and Painstake Foes</li>\n<li>Friday, November 11th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#231:</span> Writers’ Room: A minor villain gets real scary</li>\n<li>Friday, November 18: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#61</span>\n</li>\n<li>Friday, November 25th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#232:</span> Writers’ Room: The Mocktriarch Story</li>\n</ul>",
